<title>HONG KONG: Morgan Stanley launches red chip basket warrants.</title>
<headline>Morgan Stanley launches red chip basket warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley (Jersey) Ltd said on Friday it has launched 175 million American style warrants on a basket of Hong Kong red chip shares.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises of:</p>
<p> China Resources Enterprises Ltd	 0.0384 shares</p>
<p> Shanghai Industrial Holdings Ltd	0.02304 shares</p>
<p> COSCO Pacific Ltd			   0.06451 shares</p>
<p> Guangdong Investment Ltd		  0.0768 shares</p>
<p> China Overseas Land &amp; Investment Ltd  0.13976 shares</p>
<p> China Merchant Holdings		   0.02304 shares</p>
<p> Guangzhou Investment Co Ltd	     0.09983 shares</p>
<p> China Travel International		0.09445 shares</p>
<p> Ng Fung Hong Ltd			    0.03302 shares</p>
<p> Guangnan (Holdings) Ltd		   0.03225 shares</p>
<p> Ka Wah Bank Ltd (Hong Kong)	     0.03379 shares</p>
<p> CNPC (Hong Kong) Ltd			0.15743 shares</p>
<p> Union Bank Hong Kong			0.01229 shares</p>
<p> Top Glory International Holdings Ltd  0.1536 shares</p>
<p> China Aerospace International Holdings 0.0414 shares</p>
<p> Founder (Hong Kong) Ltd		   0.01843 shares</p>
<p> China Everbright International	  0.04377 shares</p>
<p> Legend Holdings Ltd			 0.03379 shares</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	 HK$7.5524	PREMIUM	 18.19 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	  HK$0.2366	GEARING	 3.55x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	   19.JUN.98	MIN EXER LOT  100,000</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT     HK$8.3917</p>
<p> LISTING		LUXEMBOURG</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441.  http://www.hk97.com</p>
</text>
